  "summary": {
    "text": "GPT-5.1 is an upgrade of OpenAI's GPT-5 series for text and image input, released in ChatGPT on 12 November 2025 as GPT-5.1 Instant and GPT-5.1 Thinking and in the API a day later. OpenAI says both adapt their thinking time to each question. The API model gpt-5.1 was deprecated on 1 October 2026.",
    "sources": [
